            crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "‘garbled’ cloves, i.e. the refuse of cloves, extraneous matter (OED s.v. garble n.) | probably 'garbled' cloves, i.e. refuse, with extraneous matter (OED s.v. garble n.) | 'garbled' spices, i.e. the refuse of spices, extraneous matter (followed by genetive of spice name) (OED s.v. garble) see alum debilis; grani paradisi, maces, spyknard | refuse spices, such with extraneous matter (OED s.v. garble n.)" ;
